# Every config here is bind-mounted into Linux containers and parsed there (Dockerfiles,
# MQSC, YAML, secrets). A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would check them out as
# CRLF, and a Dockerfile with CRLF fails to parse at the first backslash continuation
# ("unknown instruction: &&"). Force LF on every checkout, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
